    "body": "## DEFERRED — PARALLEL DIRECTING RESEARCH IS NOT CURRENT P01\n\nThis issue is explicitly pre-trial directing research only, with LYNCH role still proposed/trial-required. Fresh #251 keeps the product at P01 project planning and forbids storyboard/layout/shot work before upstream phases. Current AGENTS already allows task-driven study of directing/camera/editing when a real product task needs it.\n\nKeeping an open standing research stream creates parallel work with no current blocker-clearing function.\n\nDisposition: close `NOT_PLANNED / DEFERRED REUSABLE DIRECTING RESEARCH`. Preserve prior findings as source material for the later applicable studio phase.",
